"Read and change Instagram's own internal settings. Known names are built in; configs shown only as a number have obfuscated names we can't recover yet. If Instagram crashes on launch three times in a row, your changes are cleared for you." = "读取并更改 Instagram 自己的内部设置。已知名称已内置；仅以编号显示的配置其名称已被混淆，目前无法恢复。若 Instagram 启动时连续崩溃三次，你的更改会被自动清除。";
"This changes Instagram's own internal settings. Some can break features or cause crashes until you switch them back.\n\nChanges stay on this device. Most take effect right away, and some only after you restart Instagram. If it crashes on launch three times in a row, they're cleared for you.\n\nInstagram can tell when a setting doesn't match what its server sent. It's very unlikely to affect your account, but not impossible. Use at your own risk." = "这会更改 Instagram 自己的内部设置。有些设置在你改回之前可能会破坏功能或导致崩溃。\n\n更改保存在本设备上。大多数会立即生效，少数只有在你重启 Instagram 后才生效。若启动时连续崩溃三次，更改会被自动清除。\n\n当某项设置与其服务器下发的值不一致时，Instagram 能够察觉。这影响你账号的可能性极低，但并非没有。使用风险自负。";
"Tap a field to copy. Tap a value below to edit." = "点按字段可复制。点按下方数值可编辑。";
"%lu configs  ·  %lu named" = "%lu 项配置  ·  %lu 项有名称";

"Clear cache now" = "立即清除缓存";
"Delete staged captures that haven't been unsent yet" = "删除尚未撤回的待处理捕获";
"Clear view-once cache" = "清除阅后即焚缓存";
"Delete all staged captures that haven't been unsent? Anything already saved to the log is kept." = "删除所有尚未撤回的待处理捕获？已保存到记录中的内容会保留。";
"Capture while closed" = "应用关闭时捕获";
"Save media that arrives while Instagram is closed" = "保存 Instagram 关闭时收到的媒体";
"⚠️ Only works on the full Instagram build with plugins, signed with a paid, ad-hoc certificate under the default Instagram bundle id. The no-plugins build has no notification extension. Requires the deleted messages log to stay on.\n\nCatches view-once media (and normal media if enabled) that arrives while Instagram is fully closed, using the notification extension. Affects only this log and its media, nothing else in the app. It rides push notifications, so muted chats, Do Not Disturb or disabled notifications miss messages; \"Keep running in background\" is the fallback." = "⚠️ 仅在使用默认 Instagram 套装 ID、由付费（临时）证书签名的含插件完整版 Instagram 上有效。纯净版（无插件）没有通知扩展。需要保持“已删除消息记录”开启。\n\n通过通知扩展，捕获 Instagram 完全关闭时收到的阅后即焚（如启用则包括普通）媒体。仅影响此记录及其媒体，不影响应用其他部分。依赖推送通知，因此静音聊天、勿扰模式或关闭通知会漏收消息；“保持后台运行”是备用方案。";
"Uses the notification extension to save media that arrives with the app closed" = "使用通知扩展保存应用关闭时收到的媒体";
"Also capture normal media" = "同时捕获普通媒体";
"Not just view-once. Uses a lot more storage" = "不仅是阅后即焚。占用多得多的存储空间";
"Auto-clean" = "自动清理";
"Limit how much captured media is kept" = "限制保留的已捕获媒体数量";
"Size limit" = "大小上限";
"Keep at most this per account" = "每个账号最多保留此数量";
"MB" = "MB";
