"Trim each account by size and age" = "按大小和时长限制每个账号";
"Kept per account. A capture is dropped once it passes either limit." = "按账号保留。捕获超过任一上限即被删除。";
"With both off, captures are kept until they're unsent. Turning one on turns the other off. Anything actually unsent is saved to the log first and is never cleaned here." = "两者都关闭时，捕获会一直保留直到被撤回。开启其中一个会关闭另一个。真正被撤回的内容会先保存到记录中，且不会在此清理。";
